    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Molly on this pirate-themed romp to collect candy!\u00a0 But be careful, ghosts and other undead forces are out to stop you!\u00a0 You'll need quick reflexes and quick thinking to be able to out-maneuver the ghost pirates and collect all the confectionary-treasure you can!\u00a0 This is a game that no fan of the classics should miss!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay styled after the golden age of arcade games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple styles of gameplay to keep things fresh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn high scores!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn artwork!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI generation (machine learning) was used in creating this game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Molly on this pirate-themed romp to collect candy!\u00a0 But be careful, ghosts and other undead forces are out to stop you!\u00a0 You'll need quick reflexes and quick thinking to be able to out-maneuver the ghost pirates and collect all the confectionary-treasure you can!\u00a0 This is a game that no fan of the classics should miss!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay styled after the golden age of arcade games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple styles of gameplay to keep things fresh!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn high scores!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn artwork!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI generation (machine learning) was used in creating this game.</p>",
